    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Commission is a London-based graphic design and branding studio (Peckham, SE London) founded in 2013 by Creative Directors David McFarlane and Christopher Moorby (ex-Spin and Made Thought respectively). Size 2-10, currently around 9 people. Their work spans visual identity, print, packaging, editorial, advertising, and digital media for luxury and cultural clients including LVMH, Fenty, RIMOWA, Tiffany, Zegna, Aesop, and Lex Records. Highly specialised, craft-led studio with a material and typographic sensibility. Seniority: studio-level CDs with 10+ years of senior practice; the founders remain hands-on across all projects. Capabilities likely extend to Identity systems and Brand strategy beyond the existing Graphic design tag; see Open Questions.",
      "source_url": null,
      "verified_at": "2026-07-11T03:18:48",
